{comment: Intro}
|: F F sus F F 2 F/Bb F sus /Bb F/Bb F 2 /Bb :|
|: F/A Bb 2 C Dm 7 :| x4
F/A Bb 2 C (F-G-Bb-A-C)
Verses
F/A Gm 7 C Dm 7 F/A Gm 7 C Dm 7
1. God is my salvation. His name my sword and shield.
2. I will not fear battle. I hear Him speaking life.
F/A Gm 7 C Dm 7 F/A Gm 7 C Dm 7
1. His Word speaks my victory. His blood says I am healed.
2. Rejoice not, my enemy. When I fall I shall arise.

{comment: Pre-Chorus}
Gm 7 BbM 7
1. All power, dominion, to God who never fails.
2. All honor, and glory to the immortal God.
Gm 7 EbM 7
1. I’m rising in victory, no weapon can prevail.
2. I’m rising in victory, the Lord, my strength and song.

{comment: Chorus}
[F/A]|: Let t[Bb]he weak say, I am strong.
C Dm 7
Let the poor say, I am rich.
F/A Bb C Dm 7 C/E F
Let the church rise in faith we rise :|

{comment: Interlude 1}
F/A Bb 2 C Dm 7 F/A Bb 2 C (F-G-Bb-A-C)
{ci: Repeat Verse, Pre-Chorus, and Chorus}

{comment: Interlude 2}
Gm 7 C Gm 7 C

{comment: Bridge}
{ci: 2x - soloist, 2x men only, 2x ladies only}
Gm 7
The enemy is under my feet.
Every[C] lie he speaks is defeated.

{comment: Vamp}
{ci: G - Bb - F - F}
By the power of the blood
(G - Bb - G - C - Bb - F - E - C - Bb) *repeat 5x
And the word of our testimony. *last time drive Bb instead
{ci: Repeat Chorus 2}

{comment: Interlude 3}
|: F/A Bb C Dm 7 :|
